WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,620
The people who removed the seedlings are here again

2
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:05,620
Two hundred and ninety-eight nights

3
00:00:05,620 --> 00:00:07,900
Is it over yet?

4
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:10,160
I almost got wet during the day

5
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:12,160
At night, I have to step on them in different ways.

6
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:15,760
less nonsense

7
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:18,240
No. 99 Blackpool

8
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:20,240
Xiaoxia, everyone stand up with me

9
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:23,170
Let's beat him together

10
00:00:23,170 --> 00:00:29,970
This is finally interesting

11
00:00:29,970 --> 00:00:32,800
You know, you're pretending to look at my Thundercrow airship like this

12
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:36,560
I always take the Sai Wan copper route

13
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:42,620
Why can't you look at my Shangduchen?

14
00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:46,800
give me a chance
